join Dumi (Neutral) left
join Hope (Neutral) right
Dumi: Sheeting, most of the pipe, and a tank that needs work. That's what we've got.
- That's not everything
	Hope: That's not everything.
	Dumi: No. We're short the valves and about half the cement.
	Dumi: Nobody builds this in a fortnight. It'll be after harvest before there are hands free anyway, and by then I'll have found the valves.
	- How can you be sure?
		Hope: How can you be sure?
		Dumi: I can't. But I've got three months and eleven people I haven't asked yet.
	Dumi: This is the slow part. It's not the stuck part. There's a difference and people confuse them.
[signal arg="hearts:dumi:2"]
set {GameState.quest_dumi_outpost_sourcing_main} = "complete"
set {GameState.outpost_materials_partial} = true
